; The two flanks stop at |x| = 3.5, not 2.5. A `KitDoorway` is a WALL PANEL with
; a hole in it, not a hole: it needs stone either side of the opening to carry
; its jambs, and at a 5 m gap around a 5 m opening there was none for them to
; stand on. See DoorwayNorth for what the tight gap actually cost.
